ometied will test your communication, memory and team coordination. While it can be played solo, it truly shines when you and your friends are playing over a voice call!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DECIPHER THE ANCIENT TOME</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is your team's single source of knowledge. Quickly navigate its pages, interpret cryptic recipes and puzzle instructions, and communicate them clearly to the rest of the team.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/45dc5b3b87fea0cea0c3255f081beb93.poster.avif?t=1757965380\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/45dc5b3b87fea0cea0c3255f081beb93.webm?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/45dc5b3b87fea0cea0c3255f081beb93.mp4?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GATHER BIZARRE AND MYSTICAL INGREDIENTS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Coordinate to solve a variety of  puzzles and tasks to acquire ingredients, from memorizing star patterns in the telescope to deciphering  code from a pulsating crystal. Designate your best player for the job!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/f8a2a9af113b677910b5cd594291e6d5.poster.avif?t=1757965380\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/f8a2a9af113b677910b5cd594291e6d5.webm?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/f8a2a9af113b677910b5cd594291e6d5.mp4?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RECITE THE FINAL WORDS OF POWER</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finalize a potion by correctly reciting its magical chant. Either listen carefully to the Tome-Bearer or learn the words by-heart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/5b3fb3af3fe63d2b536e014c0e7cad4b.poster.avif?t=1757965380\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/5b3fb3af3fe63d2b536e014c0e7cad4b.webm?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/5b3fb3af3fe63d2b536e014c0e7cad4b.mp4?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPAND YOUR ALCHEMICAL KNOWLEDGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each day you'll be transported to the  Sanctum. Unlock new potion recipes, purchase powerful passive charms, and choose from dangerous hexes \u2014 gameplay modifiers that increase the challenge for the days ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/4e0e5e1878ac846c39a6207146bb12b4.poster.avif?t=1757965380\" width=616 height=348 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/4e0e5e1878ac846c39a6207146bb12b4.webm?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/4e0e5e1878ac846c39a6207146bb12b4.mp4?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A co-op experience for 1-4 players online via Steam or local LAN.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Serve a variety of mythical creatures, each with their own unique way of speaking. Over 1200 different customer requests.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover and master up to 41 unique potion recipes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage in a variety of puzzles that test memory, deduction, speed, math and communication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase charms and unlock game-altering Hexes to create new strategies for each run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather system &amp; day and night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Endless mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Save &amp; Load system</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/fabffdfbef33762d80a238a950ec4f27.poster.avif?t=1757965380\" width=600 height=32 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/extras/fabffdfbef33762d80a238a950ec4f27.webm?t=1757965380\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li></ul>","developers":["Gloid Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3990100/5cbd37881993b01c50fcf8c0719f093a03ea1af2/header.jpg?t=1757965380","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Tometied","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> 2GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 128MB VRAM, OpenGL 3+</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Gloid Games"],"ratings":{"dejus"